1
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:07,337
(Penny:)Oh, damn. They cancelled my Visa.

2
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:10,174
(Penny:)Oh, yay, a new MasterCard.

3
00:00:11,553 --> 00:00:12,683
(Sheldon:)Uh-oh.

4
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:15,766
(Penny:)-What?
-I was going to get my mail.

5
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:17,352
(Penny:)Okay.

6
00:00:19,644 --> 00:00:22,684
(Penny:)Are you hoping to get it telepathically?

7
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:25,311
(Sheldon:)I think you mean telekinetically.

8
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:28,319
(Sheldon:)And no.

9
00:00:28,695 --> 00:00:32,035
Wasn't sure of the protocol now you
and Leonard are no longer having coitus.

10
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:33,238
(Sheldon:)Ugh.

11
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:35,948
(Penny:)God, can we please just say
"no longer seeing each other"?

12
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,749
(Sheldon:)Well, we could if it were true.

13
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:40,912
(Sheldon:)You live in the same building.
You see each other all the time.

14
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:44,082
(Sheldon:)The variable which has changed
is the coitus.

15
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,000
(Penny:)Okay, here's the protocol.

16
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:50,382
(Penny:)You and I are still friends,
and you stop saying coitus.

17
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:53,715
(Sheldon:)Good. I'm glad we're still friends.

18
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:55,347
(Penny:)-Really?
-Oh, yes.

19
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:57,973
(Sheldon:)It was a lot of work
to accommodate you in my life.

20
00:00:58,141 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)I'd hate for that effort
to have been in vain.

